<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#tariffPeriod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Período tarifario al que corresponde el consumo. SKOS: activo, llano, valle, punta. Cada instancia de ConsumoEnergetico representa UN período tarifario; el total se obtiene sumando las instancias del mismo ejercicio."@es .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#tariffPeriod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Tariff period to which the consumption corresponds. SKOS: active, standard, off-peak, peak. Each ConsumoEnergetico instance represents ONE tariff period; the total is obtained by summing instances of the same fiscal year."@en .
