<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#Arm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Arm of the post that supports a luminaire. A post can have multiple arms, each with its own height."@en .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#Arm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Brazo del poste que soporta una luminaria. Un poste puede tener múltiples brazos, cada uno con su propia altura."@es .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#Arm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Arm"@en .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#Arm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Brazo"@es .
# 
# https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ControlCenter
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ControlCenter> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ControlCenter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://edint.es/def/suministro#UtilitySupplyPoint> .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ControlCenter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cuadro eléctrico o centro de control del que dependen una o más farolas. Es un punto de suministro (edintsum:UtilitySupplyPoint), punto donde llega la electricidad a la instalación de alumbrado."@es .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ControlCenter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Electrical panel or control center on which one or more streetlights depend. It is a utility supply point (edintsum:UtilitySupplyPoint), the point where electricity reaches the lighting installation."@en .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ControlCenter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Centro de mando"@es .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ControlCenter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Control Center"@en .
# 
# https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ElectricitySupply
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ElectricitySupply> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ElectricitySupply> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://edint.es/def/suministro#UtilityContract> .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ElectricitySupply> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Contrato de suministro eléctrico asociado a un centro de mando. Incluye tarifa, tensión y consumo por períodos tarifarios. Es un contrato de suministro (edintsum:UtilityContract), con tarifa y punto de suministro asociado."@es .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ElectricitySupply> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Electricity supply contract associated with a control center. Includes tariff, voltage, and consumption by tariff periods. It is a utility contract (edintsum:UtilityContract), with rate and associated supply point."@en .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ElectricitySupply> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Electricity Supply"@en .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#ElectricitySupply> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Suministro eléctrico"@es .
# 
# https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#EnergyConsumption
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#EnergyConsumption> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#EnergyConsumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://edint.es/def/suministro#UtilityConsumption> .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#EnergyConsumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Observación de consumo eléctrico en un período tarifario determinado. Al heredar de edintsum:UtilityConsumption ⊂ sosa:Observation, usa el patrón SOSA: – sosa:hasFeatureOfInterest → el CentroDeMando (punto de suministro) – sosa:observedProperty → edintsum:electricityConsumption – sosa:hasResult → qudt:QuantityValue (qudt:numericValue + qudt:hasUnit) – edintalu:tariffPeriod → concepto SKOS (activo, llano, valle, punta) Cada instancia representa el consumo en UN período tarifario. El total se obtiene sumando las instancias del mismo ejercicio."@es .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#EnergyConsumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Observation of electricity consumption in a specific tariff period. By inheriting from edintsum:UtilityConsumption ⊂ sosa:Observation, uses the SOSA pattern: – sosa:hasFeatureOfInterest → the CentroDeMando (supply point) – sosa:observedProperty → edintsum:electricityConsumption – sosa:hasResult → qudt:QuantityValue (qudt:numericValue + qudt:hasUnit) – edintalu:tariffPeriod → SKOS concept (active, standard, off-peak, peak) Each instance represents consumption in ONE tariff period. The total is obtained by summing instances of the same fiscal year."@en .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#EnergyConsumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Consumo energético"@es .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#EnergyConsumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Energy Consumption"@en .
