<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#Manufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#Manufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Entidad que fabrica componentes del alumbrado (postes, luminarias, lámparas, cajas o modelos)."@es .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#Manufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Entity that manufactures street lighting components (posts, luminaires, lamps, boxes or models)."@en .
<https://edint.es/def/alumbrado-publico#Manufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fabricante"@es .
